    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Connect · Web action\nThe owner app (no login) sends one decision per swipe here. Every write goes through the same **Connect · Apply to Yext** as Telegram, so both channels share the Yext write, apply_log and Undo. With notify = NONE the owner gets no Telegram message (they are looking at the app). Spec: result/n8n/WEB_ACTION.md.",
        "height": 140,
        "width": 4180,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "ba1ee9ac-8b4f-441d-b381-18c64f0e3684",
      "name": "Sticky Note 1af8067d",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -48,
        -416
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Request\nPOST /webhook/connect-web-action\n{ entity_id, bundle_id, action, date, hours }\naction: APPROVE, EDIT, REGULAR, DECLINE, UNDO, PERMISSION\nThe URL is a secret: only the app server knows it.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "0b1f691f-345b-415a-a245-f414a1a8d9ea",
      "name": "Sticky Note d00c6dc1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -48,
        144
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Validate (nothing is written before this)\nBundle exists and belongs to entity_id · route SUGGEST, ASK or AUTO_APPLY · date is one of the bundle dates · hours are closed, regular or HH:MM-HH:MM (start < end) · a write started < 10 min ago answers **BUSY**. Any failure answers { ok: false, error }.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 900,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "d506e824-662d-4a83-9814-ee4bcb286116",
      "name": "Sticky Note 87e1d7f5",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        448,
        144
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Approve / Edit / Regular\nfinal_hours = hours for that date, bundle → APPROVED, then Apply. Apply writes every date that has final_hours, so earlier swipes are written again unchanged.",
        "height": 150,
        "width": 760,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "4a3124b4-43a8-467a-ba88-68ffae621967",
      "name": "Sticky Note c5eab315",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1680,
        -240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Undo / Decline / Permission\n**Undo**: Apply in UNDO mode (restores the hours before the last apply), then the date returns to the deck. **Decline**: nothing written, the date never reaches Yext. **Permission**: has_permission = true for every bundle of the business.",
        "height": 170,
        "width": 760,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "3719f850-86cb-46a3-a2b2-63bb952345bd",
      "name": "Sticky Note 168408a5",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1680,
        768
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Result\nApply returns nothing on success with notify NONE, so **Outcome** reads the bundle status back (APPLIED / UNDONE = ok). A failed write clears its final_hours again. Only successful decisions are logged in decisions (raw_text web:ACTION:date, parsed.date), which is how the app knows a date is done after a reload.",
        "height": 150,
        "width": 1460,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "e8c7dfde-78c9-4bfa-b5cb-800be73d643d",
      "name": "Sticky Note 3ee8cd70",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2672,
        768
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ ok: false, error: $('Validate').first().json.error }) }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 200
        }
      },
      "id": "6e53e194-3ed8-4545-87cf-58b65312750b",
      "name": "Respond Invalid",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1200,
        704
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const o = $('Outcome').first().json;\n// parsed must be a JSON object (not a string) so the app can read parsed.date. Source = web is visible in raw_text.\nreturn [{ json: {\n  bundle_id: o.bundle_id,\n  action: o.action,\n  raw_text: \"web:\" + o.action + \":\" + (o.date || \"\"),\n  parsed: o.branch === \"PERMISSION\" ? { entity_id: o.entity_id } : { date: o.date, hours: o.hours },\n  parser: \"BUTTON\",\n} }];"
      },
      "id": "b093c787-afcf-45d8-a901-9b792a99bdca",
      "name": "Decision Row",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        3648,
        288
      ]
    }
